# Smart Study Tracker 📚

A simple Python application for tracking study sessions.

## Features

- Add a study session
- Calculate weekly study average
- View study records
- Delete study records
- Save data using CSV files
- Automatically number study sessions

## Technologies

- Python
- CSV
- File Handling
- Date and Time

## How to Run

1. Make sure Python is installed.
2. Open the project in Visual Studio Code.
3. Run `main.py`.

## Project Goal

Smart Study Tracker was created as a personal programming project to practice Python programming, file handling, data management, and building a useful real-world application.